<title>UKRAINE: EBRD to buy 17 pct stake in Ukraine's Bank Ukraina.</title>
<headline>EBRD to buy 17 pct stake in Ukraine's Bank Ukraina.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Bank for Reconstruction and Development (EBRD) has signed an agreement to acquire a 17 percent stake in Bank Ukraina, one of the country's largest banks, a Bank Ukraina statement said on Friday.</p>
<p>The agreement, signed in London, includes a $10 million long-term credit to the Ukrainian institution.</p>
<p>Bank Ukraina, one of the top five banks in the former Soviet republic, signed an agreement last week with a group of European banks for a $16 million credit.</p>
<p>--Natalia Zinets, Kiev Newsroom +380 44 244-9150</p>
